---
title: Hybrid RAG Eval Flow
---
flowchart TD
  Q[Query + optional session messages] --> RWI[BuildRewriteInput\nsummary + recent turns]
  RWI --> RW[QueryRewriter]
  RW -->|ok| V[NormalizeQueryVariants\noriginal + alternatives]
  RW -->|failed| DEG1[degraded: query_rewrite_failed]
  DEG1 --> V
  V --> EMB[Embedding retriever\nEmbeddingTopK]
  EMB -->|failed| LEG[Legacy embedding fallback]
  V --> BM[BM25 index\nBM25TopK]
  EMB --> CAND[Ranked lists + candidate counts]
  LEG --> CAND
  BM --> CAND
  CAND --> RRF[FuseRankedLists\nRRF k=60 + dedupe]
  RRF --> OPS{Profile ops_case?}
  OPS -->|yes| BOOST[Boost structured final reports]
  OPS -->|no| RR{Reranker enabled?}
  BOOST --> RR
  RR -->|available| RERANK[Rerank finalTopK]
  RR -->|missing/failed| DEG2[degraded + limitResults]
  RERANK --> OUT[RetrievedContext\nstatus/count/results/path]
  DEG2 --> OUT
